sequenceDiagram
    actor Admin
    participant UI as Rubric Verification Page
    participant Controller as RubricController
    participant DB as Database

    Admin->>UI: Review extracted Dynamic Rubric
    Admin->>UI: Edit structure if needed
    UI->>Controller: PATCH /rubrics/{rubric}
    Controller->>DB: Update structure_json
    DB-->>Controller: Structure saved
    Admin->>UI: Approve rubric
    UI->>Controller: POST /rubrics/{rubric}/approve
    Controller->>DB: Set status = locked
    Controller-->>UI: Show locked rubric
